TOKEN OUTRAY_QUERY_TOKEN READ

DESCRIPTION >
    Actual HTTP request counts per hour, not active-tunnel snapshots.

NODE chart
SQL >
    %
    SELECT toStartOfHour(timestamp) AS hour, count() AS requests
    FROM tunnel_events FINAL
    WHERE timestamp >= toDateTime64({{DateTime64(start)}}, 3, 'UTC')
      AND timestamp < toDateTime64({{DateTime64(end)}}, 3, 'UTC')
      AND timestamp >= now64(3, 'UTC') - toIntervalDay(least(greatest(retention_days, 1), 90))
    GROUP BY hour
    ORDER BY hour ASC

TYPE endpoint
